    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2820\">You may convert certain manifestations into rituals with sufficient preparation time.</p><h3 data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2832\">Effect</h3><p data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2852\">With careful setup:</p><ul data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2978\"><li data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2883\"><p data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2883\">Cast the manifestation as a ritual.</p></li><li data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2931\"><p data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2931\">Gain increased stability, reach, or duration.</p></li><li data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2978\"><p data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2978\">Reduce volatility compared to rapid casting.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2991\">Costs time.</p><p data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3016\">Prevents panic-casting.</p><p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3037\">Rewards discipline.</p><p data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3087\">Annotators trade speed for structural dominance.</p>",
